# Prettier formats *.{ts,tsx,mts,mjs,js,json,md} (ADR-0005, section 6). Prettier already skips
# what .gitignore lists. Markdown is in scope since #344: its prose wraps at 100 columns, and each
# table keeps `<!-- prettier-ignore -->` on the line before it (`format:md` checks both).
# Workflow and tool files Prettier would otherwise reformat.
*.yml
*.yaml
# Written by tools, not by hand.
pnpm-lock.yaml
skills-lock.json
# Agent configuration, owned by the admin.
.claude/
.agents/
# The remember plugin's scratch folder: it ignores itself with a nested .gitignore, which Prettier
# doesn't read (#288).
.remember/
# Local tool config, not the repo's code (in the sandbox it is an unreadable placeholder).
.mcp.json
